abstract: >
  Rhino Python implementation of a cellular-automata-based genetic
  algorithm combined with a self-organising map, developed for the
  author's 2013 MSc thesis at the University of East London. Includes
  the original 2013 source and a 2026 patch adding functional void-cell
  support.
